---
// Mark: an open circle (the idea) connected to a solid square (the product).
---

<span class="logo">
  <svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" aria-hidden="true">
    <circle cx="7" cy="17" r="4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></circle>
    <path d="M9.9 14.1 13.6 10.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></path>
    <rect x="13" y="3" width="8" height="8" fill="var(--logo-accent, var(--accent))"></rect>
  </svg>
  <span class="wordmark">AI Lab <span class="wordmark-sub">Consulting</span></span>
</span>

<style>
  .logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .mark {
    flex: none;
  }
  .wordmark {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .wordmark-sub {
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
